@startuml
title 9.8.8 Local Model Training\nand Local Model Update Upload

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    DividerBorderColor #777777
    DividerBackgroundColor white
    DividerFontStyle bold
    NoteBorderColor #777777
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDF5
}

legend top left
  i = 1..N (factory index)

  CIN : contentInstance
  Mca : AE-CSE reference point
  Mcc : CSE-CSE reference point
endlegend

box "Factory i" #EAF2FC
participant "ADN-AE[i]" as ADN
participant "MN-AE[i]" as MNAE
participant "MN-CSE[i]" as MNCSE
end box

box "Cloud Service Platform" #FFF8E7
participant "IN-CSE" as INCSE
participant "IN-AE" as INAE
end box


note over ADN, MNCSE
ADN-AE[i] periodically creates sensor-data metadata
contentInstances under cnt-sensor-data.

The standard sensor-data publication procedure
is not separately detailed in this workflow.
end note


== Local Sensor Data Retrieval ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNCSE : RETRIEVE\ntarget = ADN-AE[i]/cnt-sensor-data/la

    MNCSE --> MNAE : RETRIEVE Response\nsensor data metadata\nsampling metadata\ntimestamp
end


== Cached Global Model Retrieval ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNCSE : RETRIEVE\ntarget = MN-AE[i]/cnt-local-model/la

    MNCSE --> MNAE : RETRIEVE Response\nglobalRound\nlocalModelURI\nchecksum
end

note over MNAE, INCSE
When the local cache does not hold the latest global model,
MN-AE[i] first retrieves cnt-global-model/la through
MN-CSE[i] using the procedure shown in
fig_global_distribution.
end note


== Local Model Training ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNAE : Load cached global model\nLoad local sensor data\nTrain local model

    MNAE -> MNAE : Store local weights file\nObtain weightsURI and checksum\nCalculate numSamples and metrics
end


== Local Model Update Upload ==

loop for each factory i = 1..N
    MNAE -> MNCSE : CREATE <CIN>\ntarget = IN-AE/cnt-local-updates/cnt-mn[i]\ncon:\ntype = fl-update\nnode = MN-AE[i]\nround = n\nweightsURI\nchecksum\nnumSamples\naccuracy\ntrainLoss\nvalidationLoss\ntimestamp

    MNCSE -> INCSE : Forward CREATE via Mcc\ntarget = IN-AE/cnt-local-updates/cnt-mn[i]

    INCSE --> MNCSE : CREATE Response\n2001 CREATED
    MNCSE --> MNAE : Forward CREATE Response
end


== Local Update Notification ==

loop for each factory dropbox i = 1..N
    INCSE -> INAE : NOTIFY\nNew local-update <CIN>\nunder cnt-local-updates/cnt-mn[i]\nnode = MN-AE[i]\nround = n

    INAE --> INCSE : NOTIFY Response\n2000 OK
end

note over INCSE, INAE
The notification indicates that an update has arrived.

The actual aggregation input is determined by retrieving
and validating the latest contentInstance from each cnt-mn[i].
end note

@enduml